      "content": "It's not about dignity, it's about acceptance. You're not just walking away from your writing, you're walking away from the person you used to be. And honestly, that's not a bad thing. You can always find new ways to be \"something\", but you can't turn back the clock. It's better to take the easy way out and let go of the pain now, rather than prolonging it.",
      "source": "target",
